                                "sense_id": "b4f8cca2-7dc8-327c-a805-773a4fe43af0",
                                "text": "The show is worth watching for Agnes van Rhijn’s withering propriety and Bertha Russell’s dresses and millinery alone."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
