                                "text": "Watch film footage from any time until the mid-1960s and you will see men from every walk of life whose heads exhibit a bewildering assortment of homburgs, fedoras, trilbies, caps, boaters, bowlers and berets, while the women present an array of clothes, picture hats, pillbox, and other species of millinery whose proper names I shall never know."
